<title>USA: Capital Pacific names Cummings as CFO.</title>
<headline>Capital Pacific names Cummings as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, Calif 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capital Pacific Holdings Inc said Marquis Cummings was promoted to chief financial officer of the Newport Beach-based homebuilder.</p>
<p>Cummings replaces Anthony Laughlin, who resigned to pursue his consulting business.</p>
<p>Laughlin will continue to serve as a consultant to CPH.</p>
<p>Since joining the company in 1987, Cummins headed finance and administration for the San Diego division.</p>
